      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Boiceville%2C_New_York"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Boiceville sits in a floodplain along Esopus Creek, and Tropical Storm Irene in 2011 submerged streets up to 630 feet above NAVD 88.",
